  "abstract": "Formalizes a regime-based ontology for discrete entropic gravity on graphs, showing how Newtonian (UV), MOND-like (IR), and cosmological (Yukawa-screened) behaviors arise from dominance switching between gradient, bulk, and source sectors of a single functional. Clarifies the role of the cosmological constant \u039b as a bulk entropic capacity parameter that sets both the local MOND transition scale and the global screening length, all without assuming a fundamental spacetime metric.",
